{"id":3,"titleZh":"什么是配器？","titleEn":"What Is Orchestration?","date":"1958-03-08","dateZh":"1958 年 3 月 8 日","concepts":"配器、管弦乐四大家族、音色平衡","thesis":"配器就是决定把哪条旋律和节奏交给哪件乐器去奏，让一百多人同时发声却清晰而不混乱。","plain":"管弦乐团分成木管、弦乐、铜管、打击乐四大家族（圆号兼跨木管与铜管两端）。好的配器必须挑对音色、控住音量，否则主旋律就会被伴奏埋掉，或者失去原本的民族味道。","scenes":["伯恩斯坦拿里姆斯基《西班牙随想曲》对比两遍：先奏原谱，再故意奏一版乱分配乐器的“错配版”，原本灵动的主旋律立刻被节奏声部压垮；随后还现场示范用小号替长笛吹《牧神午后》、用中提琴替单簧管拉《蓝色狂想曲》的反差效果。","让全场观众分高、低声部模拟“oo”（管风琴）、“hm”（弦乐）、“tick”（木管）和“takata”（铜管），体验人声配器；最后实时拆解拉威尔《波莱罗》如何在不变的鼓点上逐件叠加乐器直至全团爆发。"],"category":"基础乐理","bilibili":{"bvid":"BV1b4411k7Tw","url":"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1b4411k7Tw","title":"掘火中译：伯恩斯坦《年轻人的音乐会》| 什么是管弦乐配器","duration":"58:23","uploader":"掘火档案（掘火中译）"},"scriptUrl":"https://leonardbernstein.com/lectures/television-scripts/young-peoples-concerts/what-is-orchestration","repertoire":[{"composer":"Rimsky-Korsakov","piece":"Capriccio Espagnol, Op. 34","titleZh":"西班牙随想曲","previewUrl":"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview115/v4/6d/91/03/6d910363-a44a-5c6b-9734-2c4eec4001f1/mzaf_18441708324025396614.plus.aac.p.m4a","appleMusicUrl":"https://music.apple.com/us/album/capriccio-espag%C3%B1ol-kaprichchio-na-ispankskiye-tem%C3%AF/202391733?i=202393493&uo=4","recordingArtist":"Leonard Bernstein & New York Philharmonic","recordingTrack":"Capriccio espagñol (Kaprichchio na ispankskiye temï), for orchestra, Op. 34: V. Fandango Asturiano","youtubeSearchUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Rimsky-Korsakov%20Capriccio%20Espagnol%2C%20Op.%2034+Bernstein","biliSearchUrl":"https://search.bilibili.com/all?keyword=Rimsky-Korsakov%20Capriccio%20Espagnol%2C%20Op.%2034"},{"composer":"Debussy","piece":"Prélude à l'après-midi d'un faune","titleZh":"牧神午后前奏曲","previewUrl":null,"appleMusicUrl":null,"recordingArtist":null,"recordingTrack":null,"youtubeSearchUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Debussy%20Pr%C3%A9lude%20%C3%A0%20l%27apr%C3%A8s-midi%20d%27un%20faune+Bernstein","biliSearchUrl":"https://search.bilibili.com/all?ke